{title: Din Dhal Jaaye}
{artist: Guide 1965 Mohammed Rafi S D Burman}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Din dhal jaaye, [C]haye raat na jaaye
[G]tu to na [C]aaye teri yaad sataye
[D]Pyar [G]mein jinke
[D]sab [G]jag chhoda
[D]aur [C]hue badnaam
[D]unke [G]hi haato
[D]haal [G]hua yeh
[D]baithe [C]hai dil [G]ko thaam
[G]apne kabhi the, [C]ab hai paraye
[D]aisi [G]hi rimzim,
[D]aise [G]buhare
[D]aisi hi [C]thi barsaat
[D]khud se [G]judaa aur
[D]jag [G]se paraye
[D]hum dono [C]hai saath
[G]phir se woh saawan [C]ab kyon na aaye
[D]dil [G]ke mere
[D]paas [G]ho itne
[D]phir bhi [C]ho kitni door
[D]tum [G]mujhse mein
[D]dil [G]se pareshaan
[D]dono [C]hai majboor
[G]aise me [C]kisko kaun manaye
